;; Bill's exploding bridge (campaign only: it sleeps elsewhere, a plain bridge; docs/HEROES.md):
;; the girders at 128-142 just past the checkpoint, the red light on the post at 127. A hero
;; stepping on sets off the chain; the gap it leaves drops into the jungle camp (the pit below).
